  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This request is to add `PlayOneShot` as an option for the new avatar animator behavior `AnimatorPlayAudio`.\n\nFax mentioned that it currently only uses `Play`. However, I think having `PlayOneShot` would be immensely useful for users that make guns or other complex things that need overlapping audio.",
